  "reference": "Giipkeata Diigheanda 25",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iimida jaliida jeeda buuneeda, ak ghapka gheeda sirgweacha ak gooji fuga laja girgweaguutka ng'asheega nyaawa, ak gwasiksa siida manda giidiinyeanda ak ghwaaga ghoorjooda dea mideawa giidiinyeanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda siida adiiy iimiisa gideaba gajeabwar, gayghwanung' siida laja girgweaguutka ghabwada jih ng'eanyi ak geabwar aba madeadaanyi nea geanung' gwadeena mooneeda bayiigaaschi giteena giidiinyeandaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geamu ealas siida bayi haradam, ak ea majeanung' ghwasuut; aba gideaba gajiidu iisibwar ea ghwanaawda bayiiga, gajeefool orjeeda geamadu aba madeadaang'u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiradi ghuuta heeyda damanda abuukna booga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gadiyeeda jea eesisa orjeeda geamadu meah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea ii mideayi orjoospa gheawagi, ak ghami akaleala nea mandeawana baleanda, abeeda gatmooda siida meah maygawa gheenda majeegeesa gheaw muut ak ghaghi rabascheanda; gaygageanda orjeeda ghamasiyeadaanyi, ak ghaghi ghoah gatmoadaanyi, ak ghoah siyeeda gawuurji orjeeda ghaamwat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda orjeeda was duweacheeda siji gaygageana gheawunga orjeeda ghaamwat ghayi meah, ak abeeda ea mwaroada gheawungaaschi aba jeeda Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadeepa ea magasa siida gageanda gatmooda orjeeda ghaamwat, abeeda gaygwarita jarooda gatmooda orjeeda ghaamwat ak gawa dooshta heeda gweargwa, ak gwayeesha, ‘Orjeeda ghamasiyeedeanyu ghaheawa gahuuw gheawunga orjeeda ghaamwat aba jeeda Israeli; magasa gwasinnean gadiyeeda siyeedeanyu was orjeeda ghaamwat.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gaygaguursa gweargwa mujiineadaanyi siidida, ak goobalool siidida: ama heawa, nea gwayi, ‘Aniini meagassi daghi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gaygawa heeda gatmooda orjeeda ghaamwat aba madeeda gweargwa, ak ghafwakta geeweeda geeshtaanyi, ak goong'uusha gheanyangaaschi; ak ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, ‘Nih gichea eesima siida magasa deeknooda gheeda orjeeda ghaamwadi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gheawungeaba gheanyi gajeeguura aba jeeda Israeli, Gheeda siida sifwakta geeweeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Deaweedajeega suuk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea iibearji siida sea nuut, ak ghwaan gatmoomba siyagi ghaweat siyeadaanyi aba geatinda siida bwar, ak ghoahaakta geadi ak ghoang'waay madeeda siida, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gilaji geatindaanyi; adiidu ghabwayda gheang'daang'u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adagwanda jeeda shageadaang'u haleanji iyeenya siiteeniida, was daahaw ea daamwanang'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adagwanda jeedeaba gheang'u haleanji iyeenya siiteeniida, daahaw ea daamwanang'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa mideawana gidasiiteeniida doabiiwaat, gidasiiteeniida doabiiwaat gagasa mideawana; ak ghoahaada eawoojigaagu aba ng'eanyiida goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fuga sean sina ng'asheega uurji suh, fuga sean sina ng'asheega miidoobiiweadi, abeeda gwasin gea anyareas NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rukunooda bayiiga fuga Amaleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Apkaada gidaghayi simaneey fuga Amaleki aba naweeda, damanda ghayi ooleapni Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "damanda ghayi nyasaneey naweeda, ak ghabwar fugaagu sinung'usa bwadaw was fuga ng'arng'ari sinung'wa bwadaw, damanda ipuri ea ahiila nea meawala ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi inyas gagoonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U fuufeanda aba heeda weajoodigaagu sean neaweesa ng'eanyiida goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ak gihearani nea giibiidi, ak abeeda giduulu fuga Amaleki ea manda eara guushta jea eapkaat aba hiing'eadayda humng'eeda; asi adagwarooseey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
